{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_235_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_235","textTraditional":"一、八年。春王正月，宋公入曹，以曹伯陽歸。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_235_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_235","textTraditional":"曹伯陽何以名？絕。曷為絕之？滅也。曷為不言其滅？諱同姓之滅也。何諱乎同姓之滅？力能救之而不救也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_235_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_235","textTraditional":"二、吳伐我。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_235_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_235","textTraditional":"三、夏，齊人取讙及僤。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_235_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_235","textTraditional":"外取邑不書，此何以書？所以賂齊也。曷為賂齊？為以邾婁子益來也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_235_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_235","textTraditional":"四、歸邾婁子益于邾婁。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_235_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_235","textTraditional":"五、秋七月。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_235_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_235","textTraditional":"六、冬十有二月癸亥，〈木巳〉伯過卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_235_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_235","textTraditional":"七、齊人歸讙及僤。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}